==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Zory]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

